{"reviews":[{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-0","r":5.0,"t":"The Finishing Step","x":"I'm a beauty blogger ([...]) and originally received this product in a goodie bag. I find it does a great job of setting my make up for the day and leaves my skin looking dewy not dry. It takes a long time to go through a bottle and it's very well priced. It's worth the 2 extra seconds of time, to get a full days wear out of my face and eye makeup.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-1","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome product!","x":"I love Mary kay and this just might be my favorite product! Keeps my makeup lasting all day. Product arrived on time with no damages.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2013"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-2","r":5.0,"t":"Finishing spray","x":"I was impressed with this product :-)  Several years ago I used a finishing spray....can't remember the brand.  I liked it, but when I needed to replace it, it was just too pricy!  This one is a better fit in my budget, and works every bit as well.  The spray wasn't quite as fine as I had hoped, but it didn't cause my makeup to run or smudge and kept me fresh looking all day.  I'd certainly recommend it :-)","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-3","r":5.0,"t":"love love love","x":"wow!!! i spray this on and my make up stays for the entire day. i will always purchase this product. i recommend to all the ladies","h":8,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-4","r":4.0,"t":"Great extra","x":"Use this a lot and am happy with it.  Helps extend the life of my makeup on those really long days!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2013"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-5","r":5.0,"t":"A must have!!!!","x":"This is a must have! I use it with a foam sponge applicator after putting on my foundation and it does miracles in keeping your foundation from melting off in the hot sun. Also, it does a great job in eliminating caked makeup in the wrinkles around my mouth. Absolutely buy!!!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-6","r":3.0,"t":"It's alright","x":"I wear Mary Kay foundation and concealer everyday and even though I use the finishing spray makeup still fades throughout the day. I wonder if it even works. Probably won't buy this brand again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2013"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-7","r":3.0,"t":"Just okay!","x":"This product is okay, but doesn't make a noticeable difference in appearance.  Difficult to keep from spraying a bit onto hair at sides of head.  I would not buy it again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-8","r":5.0,"t":"Staying power for your makeup!","x":"Usually by noon my makeup has mostly disappeared.  With this spray, it lasts until I wash it off. I use it over the mk cc cream and mineral foundation.","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2015"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-9","r":5.0,"t":"very satisfied!","x":"It works great! It's very light weight and my makeup stays on all day. For the price, I'm very satisfied!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-10","r":4.0,"t":"Good finishing spray. Just like Skindanavia","x":"I like it. Use it to remove the extreme matte look on my face and it works and feels like Skindanavia. No complaints.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-11","r":2.0,"t":"Left my Fave blotchy after several hours","x":"I can't speak for a light coverage, but for medium and full coverage foundation (whether alone or set with powder), I wasn't a fan. I used the same Mary Kay matte foundation as always and set with the same powder I always use (not Mary Kay) and after 4 hours it was blotchy. It's almost as if it made my make up gather more in certain areas while it completely wore off in other areas. Compared to when I don't use the spray, it lasts for 10+ hours. It was winter too so heat wasn't a factor in the s","h":3,"v":0,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-12","r":3.0,"t":"High expectations, Mediocre Results","x":"I was told this product basically froze your makeup in place. I found this not to be the case. I still seem to have my make up wiped off and my eye makeup get clumpy my the end of my work day.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-13","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"It is very wet, but dries quickly. I only apply it once for the day! :)","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-14","r":5.0,"t":"... really sets your makeup and gives it a skin like appearance.","x":"It really sets your makeup and gives it a skin like appearance.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2015"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-15","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love the feeling of this. It is soft and clean on your face","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-16","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great product and easy to use. Really works for me","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-17","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"A great product. Keeps makeup  looking fresh.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-18","r":5.0,"t":"Worth every dime","x":"I was using \u201ctoo dark\u201d foundation, I\u2019m the lightest on the spectrum. I got this to help distribute the dark makeup and it certainly did the job. I went ahead and got lighter CC cream from my representative and hopefully the spray and CC will be enough coverage.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-19","r":3.0,"t":"Has a very strong alcohol smell but i like it. Although i wish it was a mist ...","x":"Has a very strong alcohol smell but i like it. Although i wish it was a mist as opposed to a spray.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-20","r":5.0,"t":"I use it every day. You cant miss with ...","x":"I use it every day.  You cant miss with mary kay and the price is right from this seller.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great for normal or combination skin","x":"I LOVE this product! Very nice and cooling in the summer too. :)","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-22","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This works well for oily skin.. Keeps your face feeling refresh","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2015"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-23","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I LOVE MARY KAY AND THIS FINISH SRPAY IS JUST AMAZING !","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2014"},{"id":"B00BX4E5Y4-24","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"The price was great and I like using MK products.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the spray keeps their makeup lasting all day or through long days.","cites":[2,4,5,9,10]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the value and price, noting it's budget-friendly and a bottle lasts a long time.","cites":[1,3,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the product did not noticeably extend makeup wear or prevent fading/blotchiness.","cites":[7,8,12,13]},{"text":"Reviewers mention it leaves skin looking dewy or skin-like and helps reduce a matte or cakey appearance.","cites":[1,6,11,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the spray is very wet or not as fine as hoped and can land on hair.","cites":[3,8,14]}]},"qa":[]}